      "lines": [
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "t5_handwritten_note_floppy",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "A serial killer elusive for thirty years. Undone by a purple floppy disk.",
          "src_script": "hook — không phải dữ kiện kịch bản",
          "est_duration_s": 5.08
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#2",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t5_handwritten_note_floppy",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "As official trial records reflect, he posed an astoundingly naive question: “Can I communicate with a floppy disk and not have it traced to a computer?",
          "src_script": "4.02#6",
          "est_duration_s": 9.76
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#3",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t5_newspaper_classified_494",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "On January 28, 2005, in the classifieds section of The Wichita Eagle, a brief message appeared: “Rex, it will be okay to send it”.",
          "src_script": "4.04#5",
          "est_duration_s": 10.44
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#4",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t5_purple_floppy_disk",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "Nestled inside was a purple Memorex 1.44-megabyte floppy disk wrapped in documentation.",
          "src_script": "4.04#8",
          "est_duration_s": 5.52
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#5",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t5_digital_forensics_lab",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "The purple disk was immediately rushed to the regional digital forensic unit under strict chain of custody.",
          "src_script": "4.06#1",
          "est_duration_s": 6.59
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#6",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t5_metadata_screen",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "The first line recorded: “Last modified by: Dennis”.",
          "src_script": "4.06#6",
          "est_duration_s": 3.42
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#7",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t5_metadata_screen",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "And the second line confirmed: “Registered organization: Christ Lutheran Church”.",
          "src_script": "4.06#7",
          "est_duration_s": 4.12
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#8",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t5_church_website_search",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "The congregation's official web directory loaded instantly: Council President was Dennis Rader.",
          "src_script": "4.08#2",
          "est_duration_s": 5.62
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#9",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t5_interrogation_confrontation",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "He stared at Lieutenant Landwehr and asked plaintively: “Why did you lie to me about the floppy disk?”.",
          "src_script": "4.12#2",
          "est_duration_s": 8.08
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#10",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t5_interrogation_confrontation",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Lieutenant Landwehr's response was razor-sharp: “Because we were trying to catch you.”.",
          "src_script": "4.12#3",
          "est_duration_s": 5.62
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#11",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.0,
