      "lines": [
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "t5_rader_house_park_city",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Church council president. Scout leader. And a serial killer hiding in plain sight.",
          "src_script": "hook — không phải dữ kiện kịch bản",
          "est_duration_s": 5.08
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#2",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t5_rader_house_park_city",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "Yet the greatest shock to the community was the pristine social disguise that Dennis Rader had constructed around his existence.",
          "src_script": "2.06#1",
          "est_duration_s": 8.8
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#3",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t5_lutheran_church_exterior",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "He served as Council President at Christ Lutheran Church—entrusted with church keys, administrative oversight, and financial stewardship.",
          "src_script": "2.06#4",
          "est_duration_s": 7.57
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#4",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t5_scout_camp_campfire",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "He led a local Cub Scout troop, patiently teaching young boys wilderness skills and civic integrity.",
          "src_script": "2.06#5",
          "est_duration_s": 7.16
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#5",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t5_compliance_truck_street",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "And from 1991 onward, he was Park City's Compliance Supervisor, driving his municipal pickup to inspect neighborhoods, measure grass heights, and impound stray pets.",
          "src_script": "2.06#6",
          "est_duration_s": 10.44
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#6",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t5_compliance_measuring_tape",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "His harsh, obsessive rigidity was simply excused by townspeople as the strict discipline of an ex-military official.",
          "src_script": "2.06#7",
          "est_duration_s": 7.67
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#7",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t5_two_faces_silhouette",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "That classic Hiệu ứng Hào quang and institutional normalcy bias formed an enormous blind spot that shielded him for three decades.",
          "src_script": "2.06#8",
          "est_duration_s": 9.31
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#8",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t5_concrete_wall_divide",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "He built an impenetrable psychological wall between his family life and his grotesque predatory fantasies.",
          "src_script": "3.02#3",
          "est_duration_s": 6.6
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#9",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t5_family_dinner_warmth",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "His family and civic position functioned as a “Shield of Normalization” to preserve his public persona.",
          "src_script": "3.02#6",
          "est_duration_s": 7.0
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#10",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.0,
