      "lines": [
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "t5_fear_of_oblivion",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Monsters do not fear prison. What terrifies them most is being forgotten.",
          "src_script": "hook — không phải dữ kiện kịch bản",
          "est_duration_s": 4.73
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#2",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t5_detective_war_room",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "When that resurgence envelope surfaced in March 2004, our task force's primary question was not where he was, but: Why now?",
          "src_script": "1.14#1",
          "est_duration_s": 9.21
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#3",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t5_book_manuscript_desk",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Early that year, The Wichita Eagle had published a retrospective marking thirty years since BTK's first massacre.",
          "src_script": "1.14#3",
          "est_duration_s": 7.57
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#4",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t5_book_manuscript_desk",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "The feature highlighted an upcoming book by attorney Robert Beattie, openly theorizing that BTK was likely deceased or languishing in forgotten obscurity.",
          "src_script": "1.14#4",
          "est_duration_s": 9.62
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#5",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t5_narcissist_mirror_shadow",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "For a malignant narcissist, that conclusion was a devastating strike to his pathological ego.",
          "src_script": "1.14#5",
          "est_duration_s": 6.34
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#6",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t5_narcissist_mirror_shadow",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Dennis Rader could not endure the thought of humanity forgetting his supreme control and terrorizing power.",
          "src_script": "1.14#6",
          "est_duration_s": 7.16
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#7",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t5_btk_signature_letter",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "The desperate addiction to social attention compelled him to abandon his safe cocoon, solely to remind the world that the monster BTK was still alive.",
          "src_script": "1.14#7",
          "est_duration_s": 10.95
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#8",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t5_factor_x_shadow",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "And to legitimize this cognitive fracture, Rader concocted a delusional concept he labeled: “Factor X”.",
          "src_script": "3.02#7",
          "est_duration_s": 6.6
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#9",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t5_projection_mask",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "From a behavioral science viewpoint, what was “Factor X” in reality?",
          "src_script": "3.04#3",
          "est_duration_s": 4.57
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#10",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.0,
